# Each history entry records a source-supported event or explicitly undated technical context.
HISTORY={
'a185':('2018','開放封裝與測試據點~An accessible packaging and test site','AIM 將 TAP 設於 Rochester，讓光子晶片設計能銜接組裝與驗證；本課由此說明量測參考面及晶圓資料交接的重要性。~AIM established TAP in Rochester to connect photonic design with assembly and verification; this course uses that context to explain measurement planes and wafer-data handoff.','taphistory'),
'a186':('模型脈絡 / Modeling context','熱分析接到光學模型~Connecting thermal and optical models','Ansys 的公開熱調波導範例把溫度分布傳到光學求解器。本課再以獨立假想封裝問題比較幾何與材料擾動，並不宣稱該範例已验证任一封裝。~Ansys publicly demonstrates transferring temperature fields to an optical solver. This course independently compares geometry and material perturbations in a hypothetical package; that example does not validate a particular package.','thermal'),
'a187':('模型脈絡 / Modeling context','從單一加熱器到熱耦合矩陣~From one heater to a thermal-coupling matrix','Ansys 公開流程把多加熱器的相互影響納入光子電路。課程据此討論控制飽和、串擾與校準，而非只看一條熱調斜率。~Ansys describes multichannel thermal interactions in photonic circuits. The course uses this context to examine saturation, crosstalk and calibration rather than one tuning slope.','thermalmatrix'),
'a188':('2017','可重組光子網格的研究案例~A reconfigurable photonic-mesh study','原始網格研究展示可重組光學功能；本課另行編寫故障圖和容量算例，說明可程式化不自動等於滿足 N−1 服務。~The original mesh study demonstrates reconfigurable optical functions. Independently authored fault graphs and capacity exercises show why programmability does not automatically provide N−1 service.','mesh'),
'a189':('2023','矽光彈量測重視方向與溫度~Silicon photoelastic measurements depend on orientation and temperature','Dickmann 等人的原始研究量測 1550 nm 下矽的光彈係數及其溫度、晶向依賴。本課把材料證據與模態重疊、幾何光程分開。~Dickmann and colleagues measured silicon photoelastic response at 1550 nm with temperature and orientation dependence. This course separates material evidence from mode overlap and geometric path length.','photoelastic'),
'a190':('設計脈絡 / Design context','封裝介面提早進入設計~Packaging enters the design workflow','AIM 公開 ADK 說明將封裝考量放入設計流程。本課把元件模型、設計規則和可組裝性放在同一版本化交付表。~The public AIM ADK description brings packaging considerations into design. This course joins component models, rules and assembly feasibility in a versioned handoff.','adk'),
'a191':('介面脈絡 / Interface context','共同封裝需要共同介面~Co-packaging requires shared interfaces','OIF 公開 3.2T 模組實作協議，呈現電、光、機械及熱責任的分工。本課再用自訂功率邊界練習公平比較，不將單一協議代表全部 CPO。~OIF publishes a 3.2T module agreement defining interface responsibilities. An independent power-boundary exercise supports fair comparison without treating one agreement as every CPO architecture.','cpo'),
'a192':('2024','光學 I/O 小晶片公開展示~A public optical-I/O chiplet demonstration','Intel 發表與處理器共同展示的光學 I/O 小晶片，成為比較容量、方向及功耗邊界的案例。本課算例是自行設定，不是完整產品規格。~Intel presented an optical-I/O chiplet alongside a processor, providing a case for comparing capacity, direction and power boundaries. Course calculations are independently chosen, not full product specifications.','oci'),
'a193':('2016','光子與 TIA 共同設計案例~A photonics and TIA co-design case','Ghent 的 40 GBd 相干接收器研究將矽光子電路與 SiGe TIA 一起設計。本課以此說明電、光模型必須共享參考面和負載條件。~The Ghent 40-GBd coherent-receiver study co-designed silicon photonics with a SiGe TIA, illustrating why electrical and optical models need shared planes and load conditions.','coherent'),
'a194':('2019','設備發射規範需核對版本~Equipment-emission rules need revision control','CISPR 32 的合併版本納入 2019 修訂；它是設備發射範圍的來源入口，不是所有光模組自動適用的全部符合性規範。~The consolidated CISPR 32 includes the 2019 amendment. It provides equipment-emission scope, not an automatic complete compliance framework for every optical module.','emc'),
'a195':('2014','完整產品的雷射分類~Laser classification of complete products','IEC 60825-1 第三版提供雷射產品安全分類的規範脈絡。本課只練習非發光互鎖邏輯與證據交接，分類和實際測試須依適用標準完成。~IEC 60825-1 edition 3 provides laser-product classification context. This course practices non-emitting interlock logic and evidence handoff; actual classification/testing follow applicable standards.','iec'),
'a196':('2012','CoWoS 從平台走向多種中介策略~CoWoS evolves into multiple interposer strategies','TSMC 公開說明 CoWoS 自 2012 年量產，後續以 S、R、L 區分整合路線。比較時先核對變體，才討論互連、熱與可測試性。~TSMC states CoWoS entered production in 2012 and describes S/R/L routes. Comparisons first identify the variant before evaluating interconnect, heat and testability.','cowos'),
'a197':('2025','SoIC 公開堆疊平台演進~Public SoIC stacking-platform evolution','TSMC 記錄 3 nm 晶粒堆疊於 2025 年進入量產，並說明 SoIC 可再銜接其他封裝。本課關注這些交接邊界，不推定內部配方或良率。~TSMC records 3-nm stacking production in 2025 and describes downstream packaging compatibility. The course studies these handoffs without inferring recipes or yield.','soic'),
'a198':('2019／2026','Foveros 名稱下的不同路線~Different routes under the Foveros name','Intel 公開頁將 Foveros-S 的量產起點列為 2019，並分別介紹 R 與 Direct 3D。2026 查閱時，R 的 2027 生產就緒屬未來規劃，不能寫成既成量產。~Intel lists Foveros-S production beginning in 2019 and separately describes R and Direct 3D. At the 2026 review, the R 2027 production-ready statement is a future plan, not completed production.','intel'),
'a199':('2017／平台演進','EMIB 從橋接走向更多功能~EMIB evolves beyond a basic bridge','Intel 公開記錄 EMIB 自 2017 年量產，並介紹加入電容的 M 與含 TSV 的 T 變體。本課避免把早期無 TSV 的概述套到整個平台族。~Intel records EMIB production from 2017 and describes M with capacitors and T with TSVs. The course avoids applying an early no-TSV description to the entire family.','intel'),
'a200':('平台脈絡 / Platform context','矽光子平台與異質材料選項~Silicon-photonics platforms and heterogeneous options','imec 的 iSiPP200 與 iSiPP300 公開能力不同，並提供異質材料整合方向。本課讓學生先核對元件、服務及 PDK 版本，再安排流片與封裝驗證。~imec describes distinct iSiPP200/iSiPP300 capabilities and heterogeneous-material options. Students audit components, services and PDK revision before planning fabrication and package verification.','isipp')}
STAGES={
'a185':'座標與去嵌入~Coordinates and de-embedding|耦合與光譜校正~Coupling and spectral calibration|同步與重複性~Synchronization and repeatability|晶圓統計與交接~Wafer statistics and handoff',
'a186':'耦合模型與熱路~Coupled models and heat paths|材料與相對位移~Materials and relative motion|光相位與數值收斂~Optical phase and numerical convergence|缺陷配準與盲驗證~Defect registration and blind validation',
'a187':'工作點與感測~Operating point and sensing|致動範圍與串擾~Actuator range and crosstalk|延遲與交互作用~Delay and interactions|失鎖與重新校準~Unlock and recalibration',
'a188':'失效範圍與功率~Failure scope and optical power|獨立性與傳輸條件~Independence and transmission conditions|診斷與降級容量~Diagnosis and degraded capacity|熱校正與恢復~Thermal calibration and restoration',
'a189':'應力定義與相位~Stress definitions and phase|張量與移動邊界~Tensors and moving boundaries|偏振與擾動分離~Polarization and perturbation separation|相位解纏與驗證~Phase unwrapping and verification',
'a190':'版本與版圖規則~Versions and layout rules|端口與統計角落~Ports and statistical corners|模型守恆與量測~Model conservation and measurement|組裝與釋出回歸~Assembly and release regression',
'a191':'系統邊界與容量~System boundary and capacity|熱源與光纖接口~Heat sources and fiber interfaces|功耗與共同測試~Power and joint testing|維修與系統驗收~Service and system acceptance',
'a192':'容量定義與介面~Capacity definitions and interfaces|波長與能量預算~Wavelength and energy budgets|誤碼與熱延遲~Errors and thermal latency|退化與生命週期~Degradation and lifecycle',
'a193':'參考面與頻寬~Reference planes and bandwidth|擺幅與接收雜訊~Swing and receiver noise|返回路與熱耦合~Returns and thermal coupling|共同模型與回歸~Shared models and regression',
'a194':'標準範圍與返回路~Standard scope and returns|頻譜与近場量測~Spectra and near-field measurement|外殼纜線與濾波~Enclosure cables and filters|免疫性與回歸~Immunity and regression',
'a195':'產品與標準邊界~Product and standard boundaries|端點與故障狀態~Endpoints and failure states|延遲與共同原因~Delay and common causes|維修文件與驗證~Service records and validation',
'a196':'平台與功能分割~Platform and partitioning|互連與良品介面~Interconnect and screened components|電熱與翹曲~Electrical thermal and warpage|測試成本與交接~Test cost and handoff',
'a197':'堆疊路線與分割~Stacking routes and partitioning|來料與接合界面~Incoming quality and bond interfaces|跨層電熱~Cross-tier electrical and thermal|測試良率與後段~Test yield and downstream packaging',
'a198':'變體與接合路線~Variants and bonding routes|能量與供電域~Energy and power domains|熱訊號與測試~Heat signals and test|良率與平台組合~Yield and platform composition',
'a199':'橋接版本與配置~Bridge variants and placement|對準接點與傳播~Alignment contacts and propagation|返回路供電與應力~Returns power and stress|測試成本與組合~Test cost and composition',
'a200':'平台材料與套件~Platform materials and kits|光譜與主動介面~Spectra and active interfaces|異質整合與服務~Heterogeneous integration and services|試片統計與釋出~Coupons statistics and release'}
for c,p in zip(COURSES,PLACES):
 cid=c['id']; pl=BASEPLACE; location='aimlocation'
 if cid in ['a196','a197']:pl=tsmc_place;location='tsmclocation'
